      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I fully understand what this function is doing. The only place it\u0027s called right now is `ShaderModuleVk.cpp` and only if `HasImmediateConstants` already passed so I think that you can assume the `pipelineImmediateMask` already has the bits set for this constant.\n\nAt that point doesn\u0027t this function just need to return `offset`?",
